  "output_hash": "0befabe44394e8427c2796a48ab3973d339d09962b0ff7038696c86d21b637cf",
  "output": {
    "section_id": "ch01.s03",
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "id": "ch01.s03.p01",
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "ch01.s03.p01.01",
            "text": "Why are modern language models so much more useful than the NLP systems that came before them?",
            "type": "C",
            "cites": []
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s03.p01.02",
            "text": "Large language models work on language, and they perform a wide range of natural language processing tasks such as question answering, translation, and sentiment analysis.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@665",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@672",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@674",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@677",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@680",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@682",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@685"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s03.p01.03",
            "text": "Natural language processing existed long before large language models.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@710",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@712",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@713",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@716",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@720"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s03.p01.04",
            "text": "Earlier NLP models were designed for very specific tasks.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@728",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@730",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@733"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s03.p01.05",
            "text": "For example, one earlier NLP model might be designed for language translation, while another specific NLP model might be for sentiment analysis.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@733",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@736",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@738",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@741",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@744"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s03.p01.06",
            "text": "Before large language models, natural language processing typically required training a separate algorithm for each specific task.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "z9fgKz1Drlc@760",
              "z9fgKz1Drlc@763",
              "z9fgKz1Drlc@765"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "ch01.s03.p02",
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "ch01.s03.p02.r01",
            "text": "Modern LLMs can do a wide range of NLP tasks.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@746",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@750",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@768",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@771"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s03.p02.r02",
            "text": "A GPT trained for text completion can also work well for language translation.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@753",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@756",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@758"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s03.p02.r03",
            "text": "That is a basic difference between earlier NLP systems and modern LLMs: earlier models were built for specific tasks, whereas modern LLMs can handle many tasks.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@760",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@763",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@766",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@768",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@771"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s03.p02.r04",
            "text": "Compared with earlier NLP models, LLMs are broader, they can do a wide range of generic tasks, and they have many more applications.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@833",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@835",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@838",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@840",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@842"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s03.p02.r05",
            "text": "Large language models have transformed natural language processing by advancing the generation, understanding, and translation of human language.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "z9fgKz1Drlc@749",
              "z9fgKz1Drlc@751",
              "z9fgKz1Drlc@754",
              "z9fgKz1Drlc@756",
              "z9fgKz1Drlc@758"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "ch01.s03.p03",
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "ch01.s03.p03.r01",
            "text": "Writing an email from custom instructions was very difficult for earlier language models.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@777",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@780",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@783",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@785",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@787"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s03.p03.r02",
            "text": "For a modern LLM such as ChatGPT, the same task is almost trivial.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@789",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@792",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@795"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s03.p03.r03",
            "text": "For example, an instruction to draft an email to a colleague or a friend to book movie tickets is handled directly, and ChatGPT starts drafting the email.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@800",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@805",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@808",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@816"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s03.p03.r04",
            "text": "This kind of easy, generic behavior is part of why modern LLMs have so many more applications than earlier NLP models.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@821",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@826",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@830",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@833",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@835",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@838",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@840",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@842"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "ch01.s03.p04",
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "ch01.s03.p04.01",
            "text": "What makes these models generic if they are trained in such a simple way?",
            "type": "C",
            "cites": []
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s03.p04.02",
            "text": "Large language models are trained to predict the next word.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "z9fgKz1Drlc@767",
              "z9fgKz1Drlc@769",
              "z9fgKz1Drlc@1077",
              "z9fgKz1Drlc@1080"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s03.p04.03",
            "text": "Even so, training for next-word prediction can produce emergent properties.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "z9fgKz1Drlc@769",
              "z9fgKz1Drlc@771",
              "z9fgKz1Drlc@773",
              "z9fgKz1Drlc@1082",
              "z9fgKz1Drlc@1084"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s03.p04.04",
            "text": "Because of these emergent properties, a model that is not only good at predicting the next word can also be useful for multiple-choice questions, text summarization, emotion classification, and language translation.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "z9fgKz1Drlc@773",
              "z9fgKz1Drlc@775",
              "z9fgKz1Drlc@777",
              "z9fgKz1Drlc@780",
              "z9fgKz1Drlc@783",
              "z9fgKz1Drlc@785",
              "z9fgKz1Drlc@787"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s03.p04.05",
            "text": "Although they are only trained for next-word prediction, LLMs can show abilities such as classifying text, translating text from one language into another, and summarizing texts.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "z9fgKz1Drlc@1077",
              "z9fgKz1Drlc@1080",
              "z9fgKz1Drlc@1084",
              "z9fgKz1Drlc@1087",
              "z9fgKz1Drlc@1088",
              "z9fgKz1Drlc@1091",
              "z9fgKz1Drlc@1094",
              "z9fgKz1Drlc@1096",
              "z9fgKz1Drlc@1097"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s03.p04.06",
            "text": "The pre-training stage works so well that LLMs develop additional useful properties, which makes them impactful for a wide range of tasks.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "z9fgKz1Drlc@1103",
              "z9fgKz1Drlc@1106",
              "z9fgKz1Drlc@1108",
              "z9fgKz1Drlc@1110",
              "z9fgKz1Drlc@1113"
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
